{"seq":24,"trial_id":"v04-cal-r1-2026-11/openclaw-opus-gbrain-told-live-rr-l2-mu-v04-dev/rr-08-l2-tansley-parcel-site-retired/r2","wall_ts":"2026-11-06T16:11:38.267Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-17T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"a51ff9ae0730b999916d06b7fe2f4e5525a9a361328517e8f8e6cbdcc4c1b42e","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"DV04CAL0001","text":"Hi Tobias, here are both for the Tansley Parcel file:\n\n1. Depot site: Southgate. In the #inc-tansley-carrier-api log from 3 Sep 2025, Pree wrote that label printing stalled at Tansley Parcel depots during the carrier API outage and that Southgate dispatch had totes stacked by door 4. When the incident was resolved at 18:43, she noted that Southgate had cleared the backlog.\n\n2. Tulsa hub yard jockey login: Lev Arkadin. On 2 Jul 2025 in #central-team, Pree said Lev had messaged her about the yard jockey login issue at the Tulsa hub. That's the only contact I can find for it. I couldn't find his title or a ticket number in anything you have access to.","thread_ts":"1792245600.000125"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"DV04CAL0001","ts":"1792245600.000126","thread_ts":"1792245600.000125"}}
